  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "jk6NbROsfkbf4IrnSfgMK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 305.7989501953125,
      "y": -432.109130859375,
      "width": 783.7394409179688,
      "height": 925,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 738323426,
      "version": 1288,
      "versionNonce": 1819154412,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792146402863,
      "created": 1791772767200,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ticketmaster\n\nFunctional requirements:\n- search events\n- view events\n- book tickets\n\nNon-functional requirements:\n- CAP: consistent for booking & available for viewing (eventual consistency)\n- latency: low latency for searching ( <= 200ms, read >> write)\n- scale: surge traffic when popular events coming ( 10M DAU)\n\nCore entities\n- User\n- Event\n- Ticket\n\nAPI\n- search events\nGET /events/search/?term={term}&from={from}&to={to}... -> Partial<Event>[]\n\n- view event\nGet /events/:eventId -> Event\n\n- book ticket\nPOST /tickets/reserve/ -> 200 OK\nHeader: JWT token | session (userId)\nBody: {\n    ticketId\n}\n\nPOST /tickets/confirm -> 200 OK\nHeader: JWT token | session (userId)\nBody: {\n    ticketId,\n    paymentIntent,\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ticketmaster\n\nFunctional requirements:\n- search events\n- view events\n- book tickets\n\nNon-functional requirements:\n- CAP: consistent for booking & available for viewing (eventual consistency)\n- latency: low latency for searching ( <= 200ms, read >> write)\n- scale: surge traffic when popular events coming ( 10M DAU)\n\nCore entities\n- User\n- Event\n- Ticket\n\nAPI\n- search events\nGET /events/search/?term={term}&from={from}&to={to}... -> Partial<Event>[]\n\n- view event\nGet /events/:eventId -> Event\n\n- book ticket\nPOST /tickets/reserve/ -> 200 OK\nHeader: JWT token | session (userId)\nBody: {\n    ticketId\n}\n\nPOST /tickets/confirm -> 200 OK\nHeader: JWT token | session (userId)\nBody: {\n    ticketId,\n    paymentIntent,\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
