    {
      "id": "-kLI49MYK_hw8-vxAZ-xB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1229.6150913412257,
      "y": 778.0184339747835,
      "width": 786.4595947265625,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1452739564,
      "version": 818,
      "versionNonce": 1848295508,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792223914092,
      "created": 1792221964603,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep dive1: how to ensure shortURLs are unique?\n- option1: hash(longURL) + base62 encoding -> collision (salt + retry)\n- option2: global counter(distributed unique generator: leave) + base62 encoding\n\nDeep dive2: how to ensure the reading process are fast? (low latency, < 200ms)\n- cache(shortURL -> longURL): redis + local cache + CDN\n\nDeep dive3: how to support the large volume of data?\n- service: add more instances (stateless) to handle write/read volume\n- database: add more shards to store data (PK - shortURL)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive1: how to ensure shortURLs are unique?\n- option1: hash(longURL) + base62 encoding -> collision (salt + retry)\n- option2: global counter(distributed unique generator: leave) + base62 encoding\n\nDeep dive2: how to ensure the reading process are fast? (low latency, < 200ms)\n- cache(shortURL -> longURL): redis + local cache + CDN\n\nDeep dive3: how to support the large volume of data?\n- service: add more instances (stateless) to handle write/read volume\n- database: add more shards to store data (PK - shortURL)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
