    {
      "id": "hH8BdzHKnfahnTvjKj-Cc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 294.4767150878906,
      "y": 167.11517333984375,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641993684,
      "version": 1028,
      "versionNonce": 735600748,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792225261280,
      "created": 1792223918062,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ad click aggregator\n\nFunctional requirements\n- User could click a ad link and jump to the ad page\n- Advertiser could query the statistic of ad click\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- CAP: availability >> consistency (eventually consistent, < 1 m)\n- latency: user click and jump in  200ms, advertiser query in 1 s\n- scale: a large volume of ads totally (10 M) \n    & high traffic of click per seconds (10 k / s)\n\nCore entities\n- Ad\n- Click\n- User\n- Advertiser\n\nAPI\n- User get ad link\nGET /ad/ -> Ad\n\n- User click\nGET /ad_link -> 302(ad_page)\n\n- Advertiser query\nGET /clicks/:ad_id/?from={}&to={}... -> Clicks[]\nHeader: JWT | session (advertiserId)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ad click aggregator\n\nFunctional requirements\n- User could click a ad link and jump to the ad page\n- Advertiser could query the statistic of ad click\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- CAP: availability >> consistency (eventually consistent, < 1 m)\n- latency: user click and jump in  200ms, advertiser query in 1 s\n- scale: a large volume of ads totally (10 M) \n    & high traffic of click per seconds (10 k / s)\n\nCore entities\n- Ad\n- Click\n- User\n- Advertiser\n\nAPI\n- User get ad link\nGET /ad/ -> Ad\n\n- User click\nGET /ad_link -> 302(ad_page)\n\n- Advertiser query\nGET /clicks/:ad_id/?from={}&to={}... -> Clicks[]\nHeader: JWT | session (advertiserId)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
